<title>USA: Telebras 1996 net 3.25 bln reais.</title>
<headline>Telebras 1996 net 3.25 bln reais.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's Telebras SA on Wednesday said net income for the state-owned telecommmunications holding company was 3.25 billion reais in the 1996 fiscal year.</p>
<p>Consolidated net income for Telebras System was 2.76 billion reais, it said.</p>
<p>In 1995, the holding company posted net profit of 1.18 billion reais, while the firm's consolidated net profit was 809 million reais, Gazeta Mercantil financial newspaper said earlier this week.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
